-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY THIS FILE IS HERE AND NOT ONLY AT THE REPOSITORY ROOT

Because this directory sits next to IMPLEMENTATIONS.md, which lists other people's
Buddhabrot implementations under half a dozen different licences - two of them under
no licence at all. When licences are being compared a few lines away, the licence of
the thing being compared should not have to be inferred.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT IS AND IS NOT COVERED

Covered: buddhabrot.bas, the two shell scripts, README.md, IMPLEMENTATIONS.md and
the rendered image in this directory. All of them are original work.

Not applicable: the Buddhabrot rendering technique itself, which is Melinda Green's
and is not ours to license. This implementation was written from the published
mathematical description of the algorithm and contains no code from any other
Buddhabrot implementation. See IMPLEMENTATIONS.md for the genealogy of the idea.
